  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REPOA CORE SUPPORT 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the implementation of REPOA Strategic Plan (SP) 2025 to 2029. The SP will operate under three goals focusing on(1) Strategic and collaborative research  including research on economic resilience, competitiveness and inclusive growth, (2) Capacity building for researchers and research users, and
(3) Dissemination of research outputs and stakeholders engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
